msgid "webfolder_instructions"
msgstr "Web folder instructions"

msgid "webfolder_instructions_info"
msgstr "The web folder instructions are shown on browsers, which can not open a web folder directly. You can use HTML code, and the following placeholders: <b>[WEBFOLDER_TITLE]</b>, <b>[WEBFOLDER_URI]</b>, <b>[WEBFOLDER_URI]</b>, <b>[WEBFOLDER_URI_KONQUEROR]</b>, <b>[WEBFOLDER_URI_NAUTILUS]</b>, <b>[ADMIN_MAIL]</b>, <b>[WINDOWS]</b>...<b>[/WINDOWS]</b>, <b>[MAC]</b>...<b>[/MAC]</b>, <b>[LINUX]</b>...<b>[/LINUX]</b>. Clear the field to get the default instructions."

msgid "webfolder_instructions_text"
msgstr "[WINDOWS]<h3>Instructions for connecting with Windows</h3>\t<ol>\t<li>Open Windows-Explorer (e.g. key combination Windows + E).</li>\t<li>Rightclick on \"This PC\" and select \"Map network drive...\".</li>\t<li>Enter the following address as address (you may copy and paste the URL):<br /><br />\t<b>[WEBFOLDER_URI]</b><br /><br /></li>\t<li>Click \"Finish\".</li>\t<li>Enter your login and password, and select \"OK\".</li>\t<li>You can now access the web folder from the start menu \"Computer\".</li>\t</ol>\t<br />\tYour login and password is identical to your local ILIAS login and can be changed in your personal settings.[/WINDOWS]\t[MAC]\t<h3>Instructions for Mac OS X</h3>\t<ol>\t<li>Open the Finder.</li>\t<li>Choose the menu 'Goto to &gt; Connect to server...'.<br/>This opens the window 'connect to server'.</li>\t<li>Enter this URL as server URL:<br/><b>[WEBFOLDER_URI]</b><br/> und click on 'Connect'.</li>\t<li>Enter your login and password, and select \"OK\".</li>\t</ol>\t<br />\tYour login and password is identical to your local ILIAS login and can be changed via \"Personal Settings\".[/MAC][LINUX]\t\t<h3>Instructions for Linux with Konqueror</h3>\t\t<ol>\t\t<li>Open Konqueror Browser.</li>\t\t<li>Enter this URL as server URL:<br />\t\t<b>[WEBFOLDER_URI_KONQUEROR]</b><br/>and press enter.</li>\t\t<li>Enter your login and password, and select \"OK\".</li>\t\t</ol>\t\t<h3>Instructions for Linux with Nautilus</h3>\t\t<ol>\t\t<li>Open Nautilus Browser.</li>\t\t<li>Enter this URL as server URL:<br />\t\t<b>[WEBFOLDER_URI_NAUTILUS]</b><br/>and press enter.</li>\t\t<li>Enter your login and password, and select \"OK\".</li>\t\t</ol>\t\t<br />\t\tYour login and password is identical to your local ILIAS login and can be changed in your personal settings.[/LINUX]\t\t\t\t<h3>Tips &amp; Support</h3>\t\t<ul>\t\t<li>These steps need to be done <b>only once</b>. You may access your connection again later.</li>\t\t</ul>\t\t<ul>\t\t<li>Connect to a higher folder. You can always navigate down the tree, but nut upwards.</li>\t\t</ul>\t\t<ul>\t\t<li>If your computer can not open the WebDAV Connection, please contact ILIAS Support.</li>\t\t</ul>"

